# Android wide bracket pairing for thirty two bit source offsets
# Input is bracket events with four address bytes
# A zero byte starts the nine byte scanner trailer
# Output consists of closing tags and two four byte addresses
# Final two bytes are zero and status
# Nesting limit is two hundred fifty five
# Status one means malformed or unmatched brackets
# Status three means nesting overflow
# Stack entries occupy five cells each starting at cell thirty two
# This module does not generate native machine code
